      [#brief-item([Nic Raboy], source-name: [Nic Raboy (polyglot developer)], [With the intention of writing a tutorial, I’ve gone ahead and created a Flappy Bird clone in Unity3D and named it Floppy Clone. The source code and all assets to this project can be found on GitHub .

